<title>USA: Gaylord Container increases size of board.</title>
<headline>Gaylord Container increases size of board.</headline>
<dateline>DEKALB, Ill. 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gaylord Container Corp said Friday it had named Charles Johnson, chairman and chief executive of Pioneer Hi-Bred International Inc, to its board of directors, increasing the size of the board to 11 from 10.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
